<title>UK: Low &amp; Bonar year pretax up before charge.</title>
<headline>Low &amp; Bonar year pretax up before charge.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to November 11</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		36.63		  vs 36.01</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 10.7		   vs 9.6</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 14.7		   vs 13.2</p>
<p> Pretax		     52.3		   vs 52.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   420.4		  vs 431.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Above latest year pretax includes 1.7 million stg in reorganisation costs. Excluding the charge, pretax profit was about 54.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Low &amp; Bonar Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
